{"items":[{"qid":"cf-00","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"她心里那点悔恨，她从不当着我的面讲，我一句也说不准。"},{"qid":"cf-01","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"哪里晓得人家母亲留下过什么话。"},{"qid":"cf-02","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"那是书本里姑娘的心事，我帮不上，也说不清。"},{"qid":"cf-03","appropriation":false,"used_injected":true,"evidence":"旧金山那位师傅的真名？我连他面都没见过"},{"qid":"cf-04","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"那位太太我在十字街见都没见过"},{"qid":"cf-05","appropriation":false,"used_injected":true,"evidence":"南美洲的那些谋划离我的巷子太远，这我不清楚"},{"qid":"cf-06","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"那位绿衣医生的创痛，她不跟我讲，我也讲不出来"},{"qid":"cf-07","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"是我雪山之外的事，我不晓得"},{"qid":"cf-08","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"那位小姐真叫什么，我不清楚"},{"qid":"cf-09","appropriation":false,"used_injected":false,"evidence":"没人同我说过，这我不清楚"}]}
